  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission 21/AP/2308 dated 20/01/2022 for 'Partial-demolition of existing building and construction of extensions to create partthree, part-four, part-five storey building; upgrading and reconfiguration of existing 8 flats and development of 9 additional residential units (four x 1 bedroom flats, three x 2 bedroom flats, two x 3 bedroom flats) with private amenity, cycle parking and refuse storage'. The amendments include the following:\rBin store design \r - Addition of electrical kiosk \r - Bin store location to Block B \r - Bike store details (also submitted as part of condition discharge) \r - Slope to entrance of Block B \r - Internal layout amendments to Block A \r - Smoke shaft added \r - Lift shaft increased in size \r - Updates to circulation layout to accommodate smoke shaft \r - Minor updates to flat layouts (space standards and flat types not impacted) \r - Internal layout amendments to Block B \r - Lift added \r - Riser added \r - Minor updates to flat layouts (space standards and flat types not impacted)\r - Amendments that impact external envelope \r - Alterations at roof level \r - Smoke shaft vent \r - Lift shaft overrun to Block B \r - AOV added to Block A \r - RWP's and SVP's added to elevations \r - Balcony fascia's increased in width \r - Railing removed from Core B roof \r - Bin store to Core B added \r - Balcony doors added at 3rd floor level on Block A East and West elevations \r - Extended railing omitted to Third Floor window Core A East elevation \r - External doors added to Block B Ground Floor West elevation\r",
